      "settings": {
        "intro": "There's never been more choice in the bedroom, and yet people are having less sex than ever. We think that's not about what's missing from the drawer. It's about how hard it can be to make the first move.",
        "story": "<p>What if getting closer felt easy? Not awkward, not a big conversation, not a box you hide at the back of the cupboard. Just a game on the coffee table, or a chocolate you split on the sofa.</p><p>So we started Playmate Labs. We make soft, playful things that help two people break the ice with each other again. No explicit images and no pressure, just a nudge, a laugh and an invitation.</p><p>We call it vanilla, and we say it proudly. Most of us don't want anything wild. We want to feel wanted, and to feel at ease while we're at it.</p>",
        "making_small": "Every game has a QR code with the rules and cards in 15+ languages. No app, no download.",
        "outro": "Wherever you are with each other, we hope we can make tonight a little easier, and a lot more fun."
